            <ArticleTitle>Cancer pain management: 'inadequate'.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>252-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The tools and techniques needed to manage pain in a vast majority of cancer patients are readily available but are not being used effectively, say these Iowa internists. For patients with advanced malignancies, the most satisfying role physicians can play is to provide effective pain management.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
